Package: intent-os
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Intent OS contributors <intent-os@local.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-watchdog, python3-gi, libnotify-bin, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, xdotool, x11-utils
Description: Local Ubuntu activity capture for Intent OS
 Captures consented desktop, Firefox, VS Code, and shell metadata locally for
 Intent OS. It stores events on the current machine, provides restore controls,
 and exposes a loopback API with a morning notification and tray helper.
